---
title: Instant Pot Frozen Chicken
source: https://www.thereciperebel.com/cook-frozen-chicken-breasts-instant-pot/
---

Place @frozen boneless skinless chicken breasts{up to 4} in the bottom of the #instant pot{}. It's OK if they are stacked, but they should not be stuck together.

Pour in @liquid{1%cup}(water, chicken broth, apple juice, etc.) and add desired seasoning: @salt{}, @pepper{} and @other seasoning{} as desired.

Pressure cook on high for ~{11%minutes}, then natural release for ~{5-10%minutes} before quick releasing any remaining pressure.
